      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The griffon makes two Rend attacks.\n\nRend. Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8 (1d8 + 4) Piercing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14) from both of the griffon's front claws.",
